  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5805.03 Request for Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5805.03 Request for Hearing. If a person wishes to contest the administration fine he or she may request an administrative hearing by sending their request for a hearing to Bureau of Hearings, 10 Hazen Drive, Concord, NH, 03301. The request for a hearing must be received within 30 days of the date the operator failed the opacity test.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
